        "acceptedPr": null,
        "calls": 2,
        "title": "Ad placement ids switched to short canonical form",
        "summary": "Ad placement identifiers across the Freebuff monorepo were renamed from verbose intermediate names (e.g. `Chat-Transcript-Inline-CLI`) to shorter canonical forms (e.g. `Inline-After-Agent-CLI`). The mechanism centralizes these mappings in `common/src/ads/placement-aliases.ts` via a new `RETIRED_PLACEMENT_IDS` table, which registers the intermediate names live briefly on 2026-11-01 as aliases so that stored rows and Gravity placements continue to resolve. This ensures that legacy, intermediate, and new identifiers all map to the same slot for campaign targeting and delivery reporting. The change updates the `useGravityAd` hook in the CLI chat surface to request ads using the new `Inline-After-Agent-CLI` and `Above-Input-CLI` identifiers.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "operators",
        "evidence": "The diff updates `PLACEMENT_RENAMES` and introduces `RETIRED_PLACEMENT_IDS` in `common/src/ads/placement-aliases.ts` to map old and intermediate ad placement identifiers to their new canonical forms, while updating corresponding IDs in `cli/src/chat.tsx`, `common/src/constants/freebuff-placements.ts`, and mobile/native placement files.",
        "userVisible": false,
        "confidence": "medium",
        "unknowns": "The diff does not show why the intermediate names were chosen on 2026-11-01 and subsequently replaced within hours, other than the comment noting they stayed aliases for data written during that window. A second read of the same diff did not confirm that a migration step is required.",
        "changes": [
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Added RETIRED_PLACEMENT_IDS to map intermediate placement names to their new canonical replacements and updated PLACEMENT_RENAMES to use the shorter canonical format.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/ads/placement-aliases.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "CLI",
            "what": "Updated useGravityAd in the chat component to request ads using the new inline and slot placement ids.",
            "files": [
              "cli/src/chat.tsx"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Replaced intermediate placement ids with their new canonical equivalents in the main slot registry and format labels.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/constants/freebuff-placements.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
            "what": "Updated the Android and iOS placement registries to use the new inline-after-agent canonical identifiers.",
            "files": [
              "common/src/ads/android-placements.ts",
              "common/src/ads/ios-placements.ts"
            ]
          },
          {
            "area": "Shared/Core",
