        "text": "The internal names used to track ad space in the terminal app were updated to shorter, standard versions to make reporting cleaner. This is a back-office maintenance change that happens one day after the first set of names was introduced, and all old names remain linked to the new ones so nothing breaks. You will not see any difference in the ads you view or the features you use.",
